          "id": 2487794842,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "In this dissector there are a few calls to proto_tree_add_item() for FT_UINT16 and FT_UINT32 with encoding set to ENC_NA (this change seems to add one more).  Although this has the same value (0) as ENC_BIG_ENDIAN, we would like to make this explicit (see pipeline output from check_typed_item_calls.py).",
